  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The intended purpose of #random-chat is for random discussion, for us people who hang out in the server daily it would be an improvement if we had less restrictions as the channel. Since the channel is used as a way for us to speak more casually to the friends that we have made in the server, it would make it more fun to type in the server.\nSince slowmode settings only allow you to set 5 second intervals you unfortunately have to choose between 0 or 5. Even though a 3 second slowmode would be optimal, I think that no slowmode for this specific channel would be better than having the current 5 seconds.",
